  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After a month in Hu Immortal blessed land, Fang Yuan creates this immortal battlefield killer move with the light of wisdom. He judges that without that light he would have no results even after three years. The cores are Cleanse Soul, Star Mark, Star Shoot, Starlight, and Star Thought. About six hundred Gu including Immortal Gu make up the move, and their coordination is extremely complex, so setup takes at least a few minutes, which he calls average among battlefield killer moves. He uses fighting soul battlefield as the main reference. Compared with orchard garden in mountain, trapping is weaker, but draining the enemy inside is almost endless and superior. He wants a test target, then discards the one finger flow shark because it has rank eight battle strength and three time path Immortal Gu, and because Shark Demon and Su Bai Man would also have to be fought.",
      "chapters": [
        984
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_cleanse_soul",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_shark_demon",
        "char_su_bai_man"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Creating this move, then star fog concealment, eliminates two of Fang Yuan’s weaknesses.",
      "chapters": [
        987
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "weakness-closed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He treats it as a trump card against the Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance immortal zombie, whose remaining battle strength after the hundred days battle is less than half. Forcing that rank seven immortal zombie inside and draining him could likely win. Fang Yuan places many Gu worms and sets up most of the battlefield in advance, so that once he arrives he can use his Immortal Gu and form it in a few breaths. The zombie does not fall into that trap.",
      "chapters": [
        989
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prepared-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_glory_lightning_brilliance",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He sets the trap again for Hei Cheng, who is injured and has only dark arrow Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan activates his Immortal Gu, opens the battlefield, and continuously weakens Hei Cheng until he screams surrender. Fang Yuan captures him alive. Hei Cheng is the first gain after creating the move.",
      "chapters": [
        990
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
